  ('ng-gccpa-03-pit-fighter', 'Main Body', 100, 'Standard; up to 180 maximum, bought 10 M.D.C. at a time for 25,000 credits each. Reduced to zero, the armor shuts down completely and is useless.', 9),
  ('ng-x67-prophet', 'Head', 80, 'Small target: Called Shot, -4 to strike. Destroying it alone does not end optical and sensor enhancement: all four Sensor/Communication Nodes must go too, and spare com-goggles and the backpack scanners restore much of it. Underwater below 220 ft (67 m) a pilot without a helmet takes 2D6 S.D.C./Hit Points per melee round and bonuses are halved.', 1),
